00:27:25.348 --> 00:27:28.482
It's nice out here, isn't it?

00:27:28.542 --> 00:27:31.154
Maria, she asked.

00:27:31.214 --> 00:27:34.548
Oh, it's beautiful, said Maria.

00:27:34.608 --> 00:27:37.670
Beautiful and quiet.

00:27:37.730 --> 00:27:40.993
