00:27:41.054 --> 00:27:42.866
Yes, I do.

00:27:42.926 --> 00:27:46.408
But the paparazzi can be a big problem.

00:27:46.469 --> 00:27:51.587
They always want photos, photos, photos.

00:27:51.647 --> 00:27:57.084
When did you first want to be a film star, Astana?

00:27:57.144 --> 00:28:04.328
Oh, I was only a little girl, about nine or ten years old.

00:28:04.388 --> 00:28:07.339
My father wasn't happy about it.

00:28:07.399 --> 00:28:14.353
He wanted me to be a doctor, but he understands now.

00:28:14.413 --> 00:28:26.994
Chapter 4 Paparazzi At four o'clock in the afternoon, Chaz came onto the deck with Maria.

00:28:27.054 --> 00:28:30.426
Maria wore a white dress.

00:28:30.486 --> 00:28:34.468
Chaz wore a gray shirt and trousers.

00:28:34.528 --> 00:28:37.579
His face was very white.

00:28:37.640 --> 00:28:43.493
Bob was standing by his radio and they went to talk to him.

00:28:43.553 --> 00:28:47.726
I like the sea, said Maria.

00:28:47.786 --> 00:28:50.742
There are no paparazzi here.

00:28:50.802 --> 00:28:54.870
Not on my yacht," replied Bob.

00:28:54.930 --> 00:29:00.193
Then he said to Chaz, how are you now, Mr. Ford?

00:29:00.254 --> 00:29:03.846
Better, thanks, said Chaz.

00:29:03.906 --> 00:29:06.077
But he was worried.

00:29:06.138 --> 00:29:09.070
The wind was stronger now.

00:29:09.130 --> 00:29:12.572
There were black clouds in the sky.

00:29:12.632 --> 00:29:15.614
Is there going to be a storm?

00:29:15.674 --> 00:29:17.035
He asked.

00:29:17.095 --> 00:29:20.124
I don't know, said Bob.

00:29:20.184 --> 00:29:24.661
I've switched on my radio for more weather information.

00:29:24.721 --> 00:29:27.342
When will we be there?"

00:29:27.402 --> 00:29:28.832
asked Chas.

00:29:28.892 --> 00:29:32.093
Soon, Mr. Ford, replied Bob.

00:29:32.153 --> 00:29:39.944
Look, you can see some of the mountains on Moon Island, under those clouds.

00:29:40.004 --> 00:29:42.655
But what about the storm?

00:29:42.715 --> 00:29:44.156
Chas asked.

00:29:44.216 --> 00:29:47.526
Don't worry, Mr. Ford, said Bob.

00:29:47.586 --> 00:29:49.627
You're safe with me.

00:29:49.687 --> 00:29:53.088
I've been a sailor for 40 years.

00:29:53.148 --> 00:29:55.720
We can take down the sails.

00:29:55.780 --> 00:29:59.152
My yacht has a big engine."

00:29:59.212 --> 00:30:06.476
Jade drove the motorboat quickly, and soon it was close to summer cloud.

00:30:06.536 --> 00:30:09.937
Kit could see the people on the deck.

00:30:09.997 --> 00:30:12.418
He forgot Tommy and Jade.

00:30:12.478 --> 00:30:15.640
He saw only Maria Chilini.

00:30:15.700 --> 00:30:20.317
Her white dress shone in the afternoon light.

00:30:20.377 --> 00:30:23.903
Get your camera out, Kit!

00:30:23.963 --> 00:30:28.545
I need those photographs," he heard Tommy say.

00:30:28.605 --> 00:30:29.666
No!

00:30:29.726 --> 00:30:31.006
said Kit.

00:30:31.066 --> 00:30:36.949
He turned around to speak to Tommy, and his eyes opened wide.

00:30:37.009 --> 00:30:40.170
Tommy had a gun.

00:30:40.231 --> 00:30:43.282
He touched Kit's arm with it.

00:30:43.342 --> 00:30:44.832
Now!

00:30:44.892 --> 00:30:46.982
Tommy shouted.

00:30:47.042 --> 00:30:52.974
Kit took his camera out of his jacket and held it up.

00:30:53.034 --> 00:30:59.435
Anna heard the noise of an engine and turned and saw the motorboat.

00:30:59.495 --> 00:31:02.196
It was nearly beside them.

00:31:02.256 --> 00:31:04.996
Where did that come from?

00:31:05.056 --> 00:31:06.527
She thought.

00:31:06.587 --> 00:31:08.757
She looked at it again.

00:31:08.817 --> 00:31:12.806
That's the black motorboat from the harbor.

00:31:12.866 --> 00:31:19.978
Then she saw the young man at the rail of the motorboat with a camera in his hands.

00:31:20.038 --> 00:31:22.138
It was Kit.

00:31:22.198 --> 00:31:24.420
Anna was worried.

00:31:24.480 --> 00:31:26.312
Oh no!

00:31:26.372 --> 00:31:29.764
Did he hear Chaz's name yesterday?

00:31:29.824 --> 00:31:34.786
Did he talk to me to get information about Bob's clients?

00:31:34.846 --> 00:31:36.348
No.

00:31:36.408 --> 00:31:38.250
He was nice.

00:31:38.310 --> 00:31:40.250
I liked him.

00:31:40.310 --> 00:31:43.510
But what's he doing here?

00:31:43.570 --> 00:31:49.748
Bob saw the motorboat too, and he put down the radio.

00:31:49.808 --> 00:31:56.211
Paparazzi, he shouted, and they're coming towards us.

00:31:56.271 --> 00:31:59.312
I can't turn a yacht around.

00:31:59.372 --> 00:32:01.473
There isn't time.

00:32:01.533 --> 00:32:03.504
Paparazzi?

00:32:03.564 --> 00:32:04.984
cried Maria.

00:32:05.044 --> 00:32:07.655
You promised us, Mr. Chapman.

00:32:07.715 --> 00:32:10.016
No paparazzi.

00:32:10.076 --> 00:32:13.866
I'm sorry, Miss Chilini, said Bob.

00:32:13.926 --> 00:32:16.226
There's been a problem.

00:32:16.286 --> 00:32:18.856
Get us away from them!"

00:32:18.916 --> 00:32:26.738
Chas said angrily to Bob, and he and Maria went quickly down to their cabins.

00:32:26.798 --> 00:32:31.579
Anna said, I'm the problem Bob.

00:32:31.639 --> 00:32:39.258
That photographer, he said, I thought Anna?

00:32:39.318 --> 00:32:41.210
Isn't that Kit?

00:32:41.270 --> 00:32:44.212
The young photographer from the harbour?

00:32:44.272 --> 00:32:45.933
asked Bob.

00:32:45.994 --> 00:32:49.416
Did you talk to him yesterday?

00:32:49.476 --> 00:32:52.038
Well, I...

00:32:52.098 --> 00:32:55.340
I didn't say a lot, said Anna.

00:32:55.400 --> 00:32:56.932
But...

00:32:56.992 --> 00:32:59.374
I'm sorry, Bob.

00:32:59.433 --> 00:33:02.176
I did say Chaz's name.

00:33:02.236 --> 00:33:03.936
Oh, Anna!

00:33:03.996 --> 00:33:05.638
You promised!

00:33:05.698 --> 00:33:07.190
Said Bob.

00:33:07.250 --> 00:33:09.074
He was angry.

00:33:09.134 --> 00:33:11.926
He looked again at the motorboat.

00:33:11.986 --> 00:33:15.428
But I don't understand this.

00:33:15.489 --> 00:33:19.491
Maria and Chaz aren't on deck now.

00:33:19.552 --> 00:33:22.724
Why is the boat coming towards us?

00:33:22.784 --> 00:33:25.036
What do they want?

00:33:25.096 --> 00:33:28.518
Why hasn't it turned away?

00:33:28.578 --> 00:33:34.072
Anna went to the rail of the yacht and shouted, Go away!

00:33:34.132 --> 00:33:35.856
Go away!

00:33:35.916 --> 00:33:38.070
Kit couldn't hear her.

00:33:38.130 --> 00:33:39.532
She knew that.

00:33:39.592 --> 00:33:41.562
But she was angry.

00:33:41.623 --> 00:33:45.746
And she wanted to shout at him.

00:33:45.806 --> 00:33:55.823
Chapter 5 Pirates Kit could see Anna's angry face.

00:33:55.883 --> 00:33:57.744
And he was sorry.

00:33:57.804 --> 00:34:00.376
But he was worried too.

00:34:00.436 --> 00:34:04.832
We're going to hit the yacht, he thought.

00:34:04.892 --> 00:34:09.747
Kit could nearly touch the rail of Summer Cloud.

00:34:09.807 --> 00:34:13.960
He could see Bob Chapman shouting too.

00:34:14.019 --> 00:34:16.090
Turn back.

00:34:16.151 --> 00:34:18.642
Kit shouted to Tommy and Jade.

00:34:18.702 --> 00:34:20.532
This is dangerous.

00:34:20.593 --> 00:34:23.394
I can't take any photos now.

00:34:23.455 --> 00:34:28.367
Chas and Chilini have seen us, and they've gone to their cabins.

00:34:28.427 --> 00:34:34.083
We didn't come here for photographs, Mr. Chippan.

00:34:34.143 --> 00:34:39.288
Tommy said in a nasty voice, thanks for your help.

00:34:39.348 --> 00:34:42.078
He pointed his gun at Kit.

00:34:42.138 --> 00:34:45.029
Now you're going to stay here.

00:34:45.089 --> 00:34:51.180
Jade and I have got another little job to do.

00:34:51.240 --> 00:34:54.822
Tommy went to the rail of the motorboat.

00:34:54.882 --> 00:34:58.963
He held a rope with a big hook at the end of it.

00:34:59.023 --> 00:35:02.613
He threw it over the rail of Summer Cloud.

00:35:02.673 --> 00:35:06.674
Then he tied the rope to the rail of the motorboat.

00:35:06.734 --> 00:35:12.487
Jade switched off the engine and left the steering wheel.

00:35:12.547 --> 00:35:15.188
She had a gun too.

00:35:15.248 --> 00:35:18.620
She and Tommy both waited.

00:35:18.680 --> 00:35:26.324
The deck of the yacht leaned down towards them and they jumped onto it.

00:35:26.384 --> 00:35:30.115
Now Kit understood it all.

00:35:30.175 --> 00:35:34.166
There's no magazine, he thought.

00:35:34.226 --> 00:35:36.788
These people are pirates.

00:35:36.848 --> 00:35:41.142
They've come to rob, Chaz and Chilini.

00:35:41.202 --> 00:35:43.845
And I've helped them.

00:35:43.905 --> 00:35:53.543
He watched the big yacht move up and down beside the motorboat and thought, what can I do?

00:35:53.603 --> 00:35:58.775
On summer cloud, it all happened quickly.

00:35:58.835 --> 00:36:02.434
Bob ran to the radio to call for help.

00:36:02.494 --> 00:36:04.414
Tommy followed him.

00:36:04.474 --> 00:36:07.836
Jade pointed her gun at Anna.

00:36:07.896 --> 00:36:11.756
They're pirates, Anna thought.

00:36:11.816 --> 00:36:17.438
Tommy raised his gun and Anna screamed, Look out Bob!

00:36:17.498 --> 00:36:24.854
But Tommy hit the back of Bob's head with his gun and Bob fell onto the deck.

00:36:24.914 --> 00:36:31.962
Then Tommy hit the radio again and again with the gun and broke the radio.

00:36:32.022 --> 00:36:40.366
And then he took the key from the engine and threw it over the rail and into the sea.

00:36:40.426 --> 00:36:44.788
Jade's gun was cold on Anna's arm.

00:36:44.848 --> 00:36:50.711
Now go and bring your film stars up here.

00:36:50.771 --> 00:36:57.451
She said in a quiet voice, and don't tell them why or.

00:36:57.511 --> 00:37:01.602
She pointed her garnet Bob on the deck.

00:37:01.662 --> 00:37:05.042
Anna went to Maria's cabin.

00:37:05.102 --> 00:37:11.964
She tried to smile and said, uh, hi Maria.

00:37:12.024 --> 00:37:14.304
Come up on deck again.

00:37:14.364 --> 00:37:17.734
The sky is beautiful.

00:37:17.794 --> 00:37:20.976
And you can really see Moon Island now.

00:37:21.036 --> 00:37:23.707
But what about the paparazzi?"

00:37:23.767 --> 00:37:25.237
asked Maria.

00:37:25.297 --> 00:37:27.118
Where are they?

00:37:27.178 --> 00:37:31.570
I've got to tell her a lie, Dortana.

00:37:31.630 --> 00:37:35.361
I don't want those pirates to hurt Bob again.

00:37:35.421 --> 00:37:38.892
She said, oh, they've gone.

00:37:38.952 --> 00:37:42.414
Then she went to Chaz's cabin door and called.

00:37:42.474 --> 00:37:45.594
Mr. Ford, we're nearly there.

00:37:45.654 --> 00:37:47.605
Come up on deck.

00:37:47.665 --> 00:37:50.347
Chaz opened his door.

00:37:50.407 --> 00:37:54.409
I don't feel well again," he said.

00:37:54.469 --> 00:38:01.070
Then you need some air, replied Anna, and she tried to smile again.

00:38:01.130 --> 00:38:07.402
Maria and Chas weren't happy, but they followed her up to the deck.

00:38:07.462 --> 00:38:11.864
Then, at the top of the stairs Maria screamed.

00:38:11.924 --> 00:38:17.939
Tommy pointed his gun at them and shouted, Get out here!

00:38:17.999 --> 00:38:22.806
Chas, Maria and Anna went out onto the deck.

00:38:22.866 --> 00:38:24.916
Anna looked for Bob.

00:38:24.976 --> 00:38:32.021
He was lying beside the rail now, with a rope around him, and his eyes were closed.

00:38:32.081 --> 00:38:36.124
This can't be happening, Anna thought.

00:38:36.184 --> 00:38:39.246
It's like being in a film.

00:38:39.306 --> 00:38:42.017
Why have you come to Robis?

00:38:42.077 --> 00:38:43.898
She asked the pirates.

00:38:43.958 --> 00:38:49.150
Tommy smiled and touched the diamond rings on Maria's hands.

00:38:49.210 --> 00:38:54.082
Small is beautiful, he said.

00:38:54.143 --> 00:38:57.054
Then he touched Jade's hand.

00:38:57.114 --> 00:38:59.446
Well done, my dear.

00:38:59.506 --> 00:39:02.738
But Jade moved away from him.

00:39:02.799 --> 00:39:06.720
Oh, why did I speak to that boy yesterday?

00:39:06.781 --> 00:39:10.272
And I thought, where is he?

00:39:10.332 --> 00:39:14.434
Is he a pirate too?

00:39:14.494 --> 00:39:18.224
Track 5.

00:39:18.284 --> 00:39:23.018
Kit could nearly touch the rail of Summer Cloud.

00:39:23.078 --> 00:39:27.241
He could see Bob Chapman shouting too.

00:39:27.301 --> 00:39:29.362
Turn back.

00:39:29.422 --> 00:39:31.924
Kit shouted to Tommy and Jade.

00:39:31.984 --> 00:39:33.816
This is dangerous.

00:39:33.877 --> 00:39:36.668
I can't take any photos now.

00:39:36.728 --> 00:39:41.624
Chas and Chilini have seen us and they've gone to their cabins.

00:39:41.684 --> 00:39:47.380
We didn't come here for photographs, Mr. Chippan."

00:39:47.440 --> 00:39:50.200
Tommy said in a nasty voice.

00:39:50.261 --> 00:39:52.572
Thanks for your help.

00:39:52.632 --> 00:39:55.353
He pointed his gun at Kit.

00:39:55.413 --> 00:39:58.304
Now you're going to stay here.

00:39:58.364 --> 00:40:04.467
Jade and I have got another little job to do.

00:40:04.528 --> 00:40:08.099
Tommy went to the rail of the motorboat.

00:40:08.159 --> 00:40:12.228
He held a rope with a big hook at the end of it.

00:40:12.288 --> 00:40:15.918
He threw it over the rail of summer cloud.

00:40:15.978 --> 00:40:19.952
Then he tied the rope to the rail of the motorboat.

00:40:20.012 --> 00:40:25.766
Jade switched off the engine and left the steering wheel.

00:40:25.826 --> 00:40:28.468
She had a gun too.

00:40:28.528 --> 00:40:31.902
She and Tommy both waited.

00:40:31.962 --> 00:40:39.582
The deck of the yacht leaned down towards them and they jumped onto it.

00:40:39.642 --> 00:40:43.408
Now Kit understood it all.

00:40:43.468 --> 00:40:47.442
There's no magazine, he thought.

00:40:47.502 --> 00:40:50.063
These people are pirates.

00:40:50.124 --> 00:40:54.418
They've come to rob Chaz and Chilini.

00:40:54.478 --> 00:40:58.040
And I've helped them.

00:40:58.100 --> 00:41:10.398
Chapter 6 In the Water The pirates tied Maria and Chaz to the rail of the yacht beside Bob.

00:41:10.458 --> 00:41:16.830
Tommy pulled Maria's diamond rings from her hands, one by one.

00:41:16.890 --> 00:41:22.861
Then he went down to the cabins and came back with watches and money.

00:41:22.921 --> 00:41:26.562
Jade put all the things into a bag.

00:41:26.622 --> 00:41:33.914
Then both of the pirates went to the rail of the yacht and waited to jump onto the motorboat.

00:41:33.974 --> 00:41:44.298
But Tommy saw a flash of light from behind the sail at the front He pointed his gun at it and shouted, Hey!

00:41:44.358 --> 00:41:45.938
Come out!

00:41:45.998 --> 00:41:47.518
Now!

00:41:47.578 --> 00:41:51.329
Kit came out from behind the sail.

00:41:51.389 --> 00:41:53.400
Get him, Tommy!

00:41:53.460 --> 00:41:55.080
shouted Jade.

00:41:55.140 --> 00:41:57.750
Kit shouted, Yes!

00:41:57.810 --> 00:42:00.601
Come and get me, Tommy!

00:42:00.661 --> 00:42:06.112
Tommy moved quickly towards Kit and tried to take his arm.

00:42:06.172 --> 00:42:11.384
Kit tried to get away, but Tommy got him.

00:42:11.444 --> 00:42:18.340
The yacht moved from side to side in the wind, and the deck leaned down.

00:42:18.400 --> 00:42:20.842
It was difficult to stand.

00:42:20.902 --> 00:42:23.854
The two of them nearly fell over.

00:42:23.914 --> 00:42:28.628
Tommy tried to hold onto the rail and to kit too.

00:42:28.688 --> 00:42:32.480
And he dropped his gun onto the deck.

00:42:32.540 --> 00:42:37.053
And then both of them fell into the sea.

00:42:37.113 --> 00:42:40.622
Tommy shouted, Help!

00:42:40.682 --> 00:42:42.290
Help!

00:42:42.350 --> 00:42:44.140
I can't swim!"

00:42:44.160 --> 00:42:49.012
Anna ran to the rail and pointed at the water.

00:42:49.072 --> 00:42:53.633
We've got to help them, she shouted to Jade.

00:42:53.693 --> 00:43:00.775
But Jade jumped across to the motorboat and shouted, it's not my problem.

00:43:00.835 --> 00:43:06.607
Come back, you can't leave us here, Anna shouted.

00:43:06.667 --> 00:43:10.418
We can't call for help on the radio.

00:43:10.478 --> 00:43:15.922
Jade untied the motorboat and switched on the engine.

00:43:15.982 --> 00:43:21.455
And the motorboat moved quickly away from summer cloud.

00:43:21.515 --> 00:43:27.110
Anna looked at the worried faces of Chas and Maria.

00:43:27.170 --> 00:43:32.012
This isn't real, she thought.

00:43:32.072 --> 00:43:38.658
Then Bob shouted, Anna, get the life jackets.

00:43:38.718 --> 00:43:41.251
Anna heard Bob's voice.

00:43:41.311 --> 00:43:43.292
He was okay.

00:43:43.352 --> 00:43:45.302
He shouted again.

00:43:45.362 --> 00:43:49.004
The life jackets quickly.

00:43:49.064 --> 00:43:52.056
And now Anna moved.

00:43:52.116 --> 00:43:57.217
She took two life jackets and threw them into the sea.

00:43:57.278 --> 00:44:03.520
She couldn't see kids or the pirate now, but she could hear their shouts.

00:44:03.580 --> 00:44:09.240
In the strong wind, summer cloud moved quickly away from them.

00:44:09.300 --> 00:44:13.340
Kit saw Tommy near him in the water.

00:44:13.400 --> 00:44:16.312
Tommy shouted, Help!

00:44:16.372 --> 00:44:18.074
Help!

00:44:18.134 --> 00:44:20.226
And tried to stay up.

00:44:20.286 --> 00:44:25.440
Kit swam to him and held his head out of the water.

00:44:25.500 --> 00:44:28.762
Then he saw the two life jackets.

00:44:28.822 --> 00:44:31.524
Come on, he shouted.

00:44:31.584 --> 00:44:35.216
We've got to get those life jackets.

00:44:35.276 --> 00:44:39.207
But Tommy just shouted, Help!

00:44:39.267 --> 00:44:40.858
Help!

00:44:40.918 --> 00:44:43.828
I can't swim!

00:44:43.888 --> 00:44:49.010
Kit held Tommy and swam to the life jackets.

00:44:49.070 --> 00:44:50.910
It was difficult.

00:44:50.970 --> 00:44:55.982
Tommy was heavy in the water and the waves were big.

00:44:56.042 --> 00:45:01.424
He lifted Tommy's arms and put them into a life jacket.

00:45:01.484 --> 00:45:04.360
Kit was afraid.

00:45:04.420 --> 00:45:11.328
The sky was dark with rain clouds now, and he couldn't see summer cloud.

00:45:11.388 --> 00:45:13.478
Where is the yacht?

00:45:13.538 --> 00:45:14.878
He thought.

00:45:14.938 --> 00:45:18.190
They must come back for us.

00:45:18.250 --> 00:45:20.630
Untie me, Anna.

00:45:20.690 --> 00:45:22.231
Bob shouted.

00:45:22.291 --> 00:45:26.122
We've got to turn the yacht around and go back for them.

00:45:26.182 --> 00:45:29.894
But you'll have to help me take down the mainsail.

00:45:29.954 --> 00:45:31.824
My head hurts.

00:45:31.884 --> 00:45:34.140
I don't feel well.

00:45:34.200 --> 00:45:39.258
Anna took the rope off Bob, but he couldn't stand up.

00:45:39.318 --> 00:45:42.949
Then she untied Chaz and Maria too.

00:45:43.010 --> 00:45:47.492
With their help, Anna took down the main sail.

00:45:47.553 --> 00:45:51.054
The yacht sailed more slowly.

00:45:51.114 --> 00:45:54.407
Bob's face was very white.

00:45:54.467 --> 00:45:59.070
You all have to turn the tiller, Anna, he said.

00:45:59.130 --> 00:46:01.601
Turn it to the left.

00:46:01.662 --> 00:46:03.442
Then to the right.

00:46:03.502 --> 00:46:05.085
Slowly.

00:46:05.145 --> 00:46:09.588
Anna listened to Bob and moved the tiller.

00:46:09.648 --> 00:46:14.178
She was afraid, and her hand shook.

00:46:14.239 --> 00:46:21.320
The yacht leaned in the water, and slowly summer cloud turned around.

00:46:21.380 --> 00:46:26.791
It sailed into the wind now and went more slowly.

00:46:26.851 --> 00:46:30.832
They all looked for the two people in the water.

00:46:30.892 --> 00:46:33.639
Can you see them?

00:46:33.699 --> 00:46:38.248
Then Maria shouted, there they are!

00:46:38.308 --> 00:46:44.520
Chas, Maria and Anna pulled Tommy up the rope ladder onto the deck.

00:46:44.580 --> 00:46:46.782
It was slow work.

00:46:46.842 --> 00:46:52.484
Tommy was very heavy, and his clothes were full of water.

00:46:52.544 --> 00:46:56.125
Then they helped Kit onto the yacht.

00:46:56.186 --> 00:46:59.828
Kit stood in front of Chas and Maria.

00:46:59.888 --> 00:47:03.958
I'm sorry about the photographs, he said.

00:47:04.018 --> 00:47:07.370
I'm sorry, I told the pirates about you.

00:47:07.430 --> 00:47:09.361
His body shook.

00:47:09.421 --> 00:47:13.144
He was cold and afraid.

00:47:13.204 --> 00:47:20.180
Suddenly Bob shouted, Hey, watch him, and pointed at Tommy.

00:47:20.240 --> 00:47:25.584
Tommy moved towards his gun on the deck, but Maria was quicker.

00:47:25.645 --> 00:47:27.726
She ran and got the gun.

00:47:27.786 --> 00:47:31.376
Get back, she said to Tommy.

00:47:31.437 --> 00:47:34.575
Sit next to the rail, you two."

00:47:34.635 --> 00:47:37.085
Chaz said to Tommy and Kit.

00:47:37.145 --> 00:47:43.817
Without his gun, Tommy was afraid, and he sat down on the deck.

00:47:43.877 --> 00:47:48.078
Chaz tied Tommy and Kit to the rail.

00:47:48.138 --> 00:47:52.639
Then Maria said, I don't like guns.

00:47:52.699 --> 00:47:54.520
They're dangerous.

00:47:54.580 --> 00:48:01.674
They only belong in films, and she threw Tommy's gun into the sea.

00:48:01.734 --> 00:48:08.450
Now let's switch on the engine and get to Moon Island," said Bob.

00:48:08.511 --> 00:48:11.062
He looked at the dark clouds.

00:48:11.122 --> 00:48:13.192
We'll have to be quick.

00:48:13.252 --> 00:48:15.684
There's a big storm on the way.

00:48:15.744 --> 00:48:18.764
We can't Bob," said Anna.

00:48:18.824 --> 00:48:20.495
She pointed to Tommy.

00:48:20.555 --> 00:48:23.546
He threw the key into the sea.

00:48:23.606 --> 00:48:26.618
And he broke your radio.

00:48:26.678 --> 00:48:30.008
Bob was really worried now.

00:48:30.069 --> 00:48:34.319
Then we'll have to raise the main sail again," he said.

00:48:34.379 --> 00:48:36.439
But it's dangerous.

00:48:36.499 --> 00:48:42.810
In a storm, it could pull us into the water.

00:48:42.870 --> 00:48:53.223
Chapter 7 Lost at Sea Summer clouds sailed into the storm.

00:48:53.283 --> 00:48:57.561
The sky got darker and it rained heavily.

00:48:57.621 --> 00:49:03.580
The sails were full of wind, and the yacht leaned towards the sea.

00:49:03.640 --> 00:49:06.782
Water came onto the deck.

00:49:06.842 --> 00:49:11.143
We're safe from the pirates, thought Anna.

00:49:11.204 --> 00:49:14.494
But we're not safe from the storm.

00:49:14.554 --> 00:49:18.046
Are we going to get to Moon Island?

00:49:18.107 --> 00:49:21.128
The wind is dangerous, Anna.

00:49:21.188 --> 00:49:25.599
We'll have to take the main sail down again, said Bob.

00:49:25.659 --> 00:49:27.266
I'm sorry.

00:49:27.326 --> 00:49:29.033
I can't do it.

00:49:29.093 --> 00:49:31.665
I'll help, said Kit.

00:49:31.725 --> 00:49:34.997
We can't trust you, shouted Anna.

00:49:35.057 --> 00:49:39.380
You've already told me lies about that new magazine.

00:49:39.440 --> 00:49:43.833
So, Kit, when can I read Harbour Life?

00:49:43.894 --> 00:49:47.206
I'm sorry, Anna, said Kit.

00:49:47.266 --> 00:49:51.838
I'm not a pirate, but I am a photographer.

00:49:51.899 --> 00:49:54.621
I only met this man yesterday.

00:49:54.682 --> 00:50:01.226
And Jade, that other pirate, she came to talk to me in the harbor.

00:50:01.286 --> 00:50:03.608
She tricked me.

00:50:03.668 --> 00:50:11.203
Yesterday, then I had the best holiday job in the world, thought Anna.

00:50:11.263 --> 00:50:15.255
Now we're all going to die out here in the storm.

00:50:15.316 --> 00:50:19.804
You tricked me, she said angrily to Kit.

00:50:19.864 --> 00:50:27.030
Maria went across the deck to Kit and untied the rope from his hands and feet.

00:50:27.091 --> 00:50:32.202
Anna, we need Kit's help now, she said.

00:50:32.262 --> 00:50:34.642
We've got to trust him.

00:50:34.702 --> 00:50:38.253
Thank you, Miss Chilini, said Kit.

00:50:38.313 --> 00:50:40.564
You can trust me.

00:50:40.624 --> 00:50:43.614
Let's get to work, okay?

00:50:43.674 --> 00:50:48.298
Now, let's pull hard on the main sail rope.

00:50:48.359 --> 00:50:51.063
The main cell didn't move.

00:50:51.123 --> 00:50:54.264
Pull again, shouted Bob.

00:50:54.324 --> 00:50:56.196
They pulled again.

00:50:56.256 --> 00:50:59.668
The wind was strong against their faces.

00:50:59.728 --> 00:51:04.620
The heavy sail moved suddenly and it hit Maria.

00:51:04.680 --> 00:51:09.962
She nearly fell into the sea, but she held onto the rail.

00:51:10.022 --> 00:51:12.764
They pulled the sail down.

00:51:12.824 --> 00:51:15.932
Well done, said Bob.

00:51:15.992 --> 00:51:20.571
Then he stood up slowly and leaned on Anna.

00:51:20.631 --> 00:51:24.184
Be careful Bob, she said.

00:51:24.244 --> 00:51:27.836
I'm all right Anna, he said.

00:51:27.897 --> 00:51:36.812
He looked at Tommy angrily, but I've never had pirates on my yacht and I don't like it.

00:51:36.872 --> 00:51:42.837
Then Bob looked at Kit and said, you've been a stupid young man.

00:51:42.897 --> 00:51:45.648
What's your father going to say?

00:51:45.708 --> 00:51:49.518
They tricked me, Mr. Chapman, said kit.

00:51:49.578 --> 00:51:59.750
They asked me to take photos of your clients and then he stopped and said, my camera, I need to get it.

00:51:59.810 --> 00:52:02.821
I tied it to the rail up there.

00:52:02.881 --> 00:52:05.521
He went and got his camera.

00:52:05.581 --> 00:52:09.234
He looked at it and said, it's okay.

00:52:09.294 --> 00:52:13.460
Put that camera away, said Bob.

00:52:13.520 --> 00:52:15.782
Chaz was angry.

00:52:15.842 --> 00:52:17.993
Don't you understand?

00:52:18.053 --> 00:52:21.416
We don't want you to take photos.

00:52:21.476 --> 00:52:26.148
No, I'm not going to, reply Kit.

00:52:26.208 --> 00:52:28.400
He held up the camera.

00:52:28.460 --> 00:52:31.873
But I took photos of Tommy and Jade.

00:52:31.933 --> 00:52:35.875
I've got photos of them on summer cloud.

00:52:35.936 --> 00:52:38.816
Tommy looked at Kit angrily.

00:52:38.876 --> 00:52:40.915
but didn't speak.

00:52:40.975 --> 00:52:46.378
Well, let's forget that for now, said Bob.

00:52:46.438 --> 00:52:49.190
I'm going to send up a flare.

00:52:49.250 --> 00:52:51.292
I'm worried.

00:52:51.352 --> 00:52:55.034
I don't like being out in this bad weather.

00:52:55.094 --> 00:53:02.098
There isn't a rescue helicopter on Moon Island, but they've got a lifeboat.

00:53:02.158 --> 00:53:06.487
Bob sent a flare up into the sky.

00:53:06.547 --> 00:53:10.364
It flashed red and yellow through the dark clouds.

00:53:10.424 --> 00:53:13.076
Then he sent another one.

00:53:13.136 --> 00:53:18.068
Please let the lifeboat come, Lord Anna.

00:53:18.128 --> 00:53:22.570
There are only three flares, said Bob.

00:53:22.630 --> 00:53:25.082
We'll have to wait.

00:53:25.142 --> 00:53:28.032
The storm got worse.

00:53:28.092 --> 00:53:31.154
They couldn't see any land.

00:53:31.214 --> 00:53:36.602
Through the night they sat and watched for the lights of the lifeboat.

00:53:36.662 --> 00:53:38.949
It stopped raining.

00:53:39.010 --> 00:53:42.472
But it was very dark and cloudy.

00:53:42.532 --> 00:53:48.266
Bob sent up the third flare at about five o'clock in the morning.

00:53:48.326 --> 00:53:53.110
Half an hour later, they saw the lights of a boat.

00:53:53.170 --> 00:53:54.712
Over here!

00:53:54.772 --> 00:53:56.733
We're over here!

00:53:56.793 --> 00:53:58.624
They shouted.

00:53:58.684 --> 00:54:03.028
A lifeboat came and stopped beside summer cloud.

00:54:03.088 --> 00:54:06.062
One of the crew came onto the deck.

00:54:06.122 --> 00:54:10.216
We've come from Moon Island," he said.

00:54:10.276 --> 00:54:12.557
Are you Bob Chapman?

00:54:12.617 --> 00:54:15.338
Yes, Bob said.

00:54:15.399 --> 00:54:19.090
We sailed from the mainland yesterday morning.

00:54:19.150 --> 00:54:21.842
We've been lost for hours.

00:54:21.902 --> 00:54:24.984
It's been a long, dark night.

00:54:25.044 --> 00:54:29.476
We didn't see your flare, the man said.

00:54:29.536 --> 00:54:32.053
The storm was very bad.

00:54:32.113 --> 00:54:39.440
One of the film crew on the island couldn't sleep, so he got up early to take photographs of the storm.

00:54:39.500 --> 00:54:42.972
He saw the flare and he called us.

00:54:43.032 --> 00:54:45.802
But I don't understand.

00:54:45.862 --> 00:54:48.282
Why didn't you call us?

00:54:48.342 --> 00:54:51.824
And why didn't you switch on your engine?

00:54:51.884 --> 00:54:55.544
Bob Chapman looked down at Tommy.

00:54:55.604 --> 00:55:00.610
Ask him, he said.

00:55:00.670 --> 00:55:04.396
Track six.

00:55:04.456 --> 00:55:11.730
Maria went across the deck to Kit and untied the rope from his hands and feet.

00:55:11.790 --> 00:55:16.912
Anna, we need Kit's help now, she said.

00:55:16.972 --> 00:55:19.354
We've got to trust him.

00:55:19.414 --> 00:55:22.965
Thank you Miss Chilini, said Kit.

00:55:23.025 --> 00:55:25.276
You can trust me.

00:55:25.336 --> 00:55:28.328
Let's get to work, okay?

00:55:28.388 --> 00:55:33.005
Now, let's pull hard on the main sail rope.

00:55:33.065 --> 00:55:35.761
The main cell didn't move.

00:55:35.822 --> 00:55:38.984
Pull again, shouted Bob.

00:55:39.044 --> 00:55:40.906
They pulled again.

00:55:40.966 --> 00:55:44.370
The wind was strong against their faces.

00:55:44.430 --> 00:55:49.334
The heavy sail moved suddenly and it hit Maria.

00:55:49.395 --> 00:55:54.689
She nearly fell into the sea, but she held onto the rail.

00:55:54.749 --> 00:55:57.472
They pulled the sail down.

00:55:57.532 --> 00:56:00.636
Well done, said Bob.

00:56:00.696 --> 00:56:05.278
Then he stood up slowly and leaned on Anna.

00:56:05.339 --> 00:56:08.880
Be careful Bob, she said.

00:56:08.940 --> 00:56:12.542
I'm all right Anna, he said.

00:56:12.602 --> 00:56:21.516
He looked at Tommy angrily, but I've never had pirates on my yacht and I don't like it.

00:56:21.576 --> 00:56:28.942
Then Bob looked at Kit and said, you've been a stupid young man.

00:56:29.002 --> 00:56:41.834
Chapter 8 Moon Island It was nearly daylight, and the sky above the horizon was lighter now.

00:56:41.894 --> 00:56:49.400
From the deck of summer cloud, they could all see the big bay on Moon Island in front of them.

00:56:49.460 --> 00:56:53.754
There were already some fishing boats at sea.

00:56:53.814 --> 00:56:57.949
Two police officers waited at the harbour wall.

00:56:58.009 --> 00:57:03.154
They put Tommy into their car and came to talk to Bob.

00:57:03.214 --> 00:57:05.576
We know this man.

00:57:05.636 --> 00:57:09.978
He's Tommy Morito, said one of the officers.

00:57:10.038 --> 00:57:13.319
We've been looking for him for six months.

00:57:13.380 --> 00:57:16.041
He's robbed a lot of yachts.

00:57:16.101 --> 00:57:18.582
Some pirates live at sea.

00:57:18.642 --> 00:57:21.434
They sail after the big ships.

00:57:21.494 --> 00:57:23.929
But Tommy doesn't do that.

00:57:23.990 --> 00:57:29.096
He gets information about rich and famous clients on yachts.

00:57:29.156 --> 00:57:34.138
And he tricks stupid people like me, said Kit.

00:57:34.198 --> 00:57:41.590
Well, there are always two sides to every story, said the police officer.

00:57:41.650 --> 00:57:44.272
Why were you with him?

00:57:44.332 --> 00:57:51.694
His friend Jade asked me to get some information about Bob's clients, said Kit.

00:57:51.754 --> 00:57:54.283
It was for a new magazine.

00:57:54.343 --> 00:57:56.752
They promised to pay me.

00:57:56.812 --> 00:57:58.834
And I said yes.

00:57:58.894 --> 00:58:01.576
Kit looked down at the ground.

00:58:01.636 --> 00:58:04.358
They wanted to rob the yacht.

00:58:04.418 --> 00:58:06.670
But I didn't know that.

00:58:06.730 --> 00:58:09.712
I didn't try to trick Anna.

00:58:09.772 --> 00:58:12.574
But I did give them information.

00:58:12.634 --> 00:58:15.116
And I'm sorry about that.

00:58:15.176 --> 00:58:20.640
But you jumped onto Summer Cloud with the other pirates, didn't you?

00:58:20.700 --> 00:58:23.102
The police officer asked.

00:58:23.162 --> 00:58:24.884
Yes.

00:58:24.944 --> 00:58:30.667
But I'm not a pirate, Kit said quietly.

00:58:30.727 --> 00:58:33.728
I came to help Mr. Chapman.

00:58:33.788 --> 00:58:37.159
He took his camera out of his jacket.

00:58:37.219 --> 00:58:40.330
I took photos of the pirates.

00:58:40.390 --> 00:58:47.812
I have photos of Tommy taking Miss Chilini's diamond rings and photos of Jade.

00:58:47.872 --> 00:58:51.702
That's good, said the police officer.

00:58:51.762 --> 00:58:54.682
Photos will help us a lot.

00:58:54.742 --> 00:58:58.862
Kit did help us, said Bob.

00:58:58.922 --> 00:59:01.775
He helped us get through the storm.

00:59:01.836 --> 00:59:04.118
He trusted those people.

00:59:04.178 --> 00:59:06.439
That was his problem.

00:59:06.499 --> 00:59:09.411
What happens now, officer?

00:59:09.472 --> 00:59:14.576
I've called the police on the mainland, said the police officer.

00:59:14.636 --> 00:59:19.970
They're going to send a helicopter to take Tommy Morito back today.

00:59:20.030 --> 00:59:24.085
The harbor police are already looking for Jade.

00:59:24.145 --> 00:59:28.400
We all need to ask you all some questions too.

00:59:28.460 --> 00:59:31.774
We'll come back after your breakfast.

00:59:31.834 --> 00:59:38.029
The police officers got into the car and took Tommy away.

00:59:38.089 --> 00:59:46.046
Some people from the film crew came to take them to their hotel and gave them a big breakfast.

00:59:46.107 --> 00:59:50.860
Chas took kids to meet one of the film's cameramen.

00:59:50.920 --> 00:59:55.962
This young man wants to be a photographer, said Chas.

00:59:56.022 --> 00:59:58.782
Can he work with you this week?

00:59:58.842 --> 01:00:01.044
He smiled at Kit.

01:00:01.104 --> 01:00:03.084
What do you think, Kit?

01:00:03.144 --> 01:00:06.025
You can learn a lot from the film crew.

01:00:06.085 --> 01:00:08.436
Why don't you stay with us?

01:00:08.496 --> 01:00:12.007
And maybe you can be in the film too.

01:00:12.067 --> 01:00:17.369
Maria said, you'll earn some money to buy your new camera.

01:00:17.429 --> 01:00:20.280
Call your father and ask him.

01:00:20.340 --> 01:00:23.980
Kit looked at Maria and Chas.

01:00:24.040 --> 01:00:28.042
Then he smiled for the first time that day.

01:00:28.102 --> 01:00:31.522
Thank you, he said.

01:00:31.582 --> 01:00:36.124
But it isn't a pirate film is it?

01:00:36.184 --> 01:00:41.336
The sun shone, and there was a good wind.

01:00:41.396 --> 01:00:45.287
Anna stood at the rail of Summer Cloud.

01:00:45.347 --> 01:00:48.447
Moon Island was behind them.

01:00:48.508 --> 01:00:52.868
She could see Kit and Chaz and Maria on the harbour wall.

01:00:52.928 --> 01:00:54.548
Goodbye!

01:00:54.608 --> 01:00:56.349
Goodbye!

01:00:56.409 --> 01:00:58.380
We'll see you soon!

01:00:58.440 --> 01:01:00.130
She called.

01:01:00.190 --> 01:01:02.931
She sat down again.

01:01:02.991 --> 01:01:05.652
Is Bob angry with me?

01:01:05.712 --> 01:01:07.392
She thought.

01:01:07.452 --> 01:01:14.594
I told Kit about Bob's clients, and that was the start of all our problems.

01:01:14.654 --> 01:01:19.106
But Bob Chapman was a kind man.

01:01:19.166 --> 01:01:24.158
We all do stupid things, Anna," he said.

01:01:24.218 --> 01:01:26.669
Kit has learned that, too.

01:01:26.729 --> 01:01:29.290
You did well yesterday.

01:01:29.350 --> 01:01:34.742
You helped to take down the mainsail and put it up again.

01:01:34.802 --> 01:01:38.383
You sailed summer cloud in a storm.

01:01:38.443 --> 01:01:40.864
That's not easy.

01:01:40.924 --> 01:01:44.145
Why don't you sail the yacht back?

01:01:44.205 --> 01:01:48.605
Anna smiled and said, Thanks, Bob.

01:01:48.665 --> 01:01:52.635
They heard a noise in the sky and looked up.

01:01:52.695 --> 01:01:55.616
The police helicopter was above them.

01:01:55.676 --> 01:01:59.427
And inside it they could see Tommy Morito.

01:01:59.487 --> 01:02:01.908
Goodbye, pirate!

01:02:01.968 --> 01:02:03.628
Anna shouted.

01:02:03.688 --> 01:02:06.619
We won't see you again.

01:02:06.679 --> 01:02:09.600
Raise the main sail, Anna!

01:02:09.660 --> 01:02:11.290
Said Bob.

01:02:11.350 --> 01:02:14.711
Anna pulled hard on the main rope.

01:02:14.771 --> 01:02:18.012
And soon the sail was high in the air.

01:02:18.072 --> 01:02:20.314
and full of wind.

01:02:20.375 --> 01:02:23.286
Soon they were out of the bay.

01:02:23.346 --> 01:02:28.850
She looked back, but she couldn't see the people on the harbour wall.

01:02:28.910 --> 01:02:32.792
But perhaps I'll see Kit again.

01:02:32.852 --> 01:02:34.463
She thought happily.

